docs {
  # Get Reagent

  This endpoint retrieves a single reagent by its item id.

  ## Response

  ```json
  {
    "data": {
      "id": "4021000",
      "type": "reagents",
      "attributes": {
        "stat": "STR",
        "value": 1
      }
    }
  }
  ```
}
